    "detailed_description": "The Wire Man<br>This game is a 2D platformer game where the goal is to climb to the top using wires.<br><br>Introduction: The player can be controlled with a keyboard and mouse, and although the completion point  is not very high, various obstacles get in the way.<br><br><br>[Key Description]<br>A, D: move<br>space: jump<br><br>Left click: hang wire<br><br>Right-click: cancel wire<br><br><br>[warning]<br>If it hits a red wall or the tip of its head hits a wall, it will fall.<br><br>This game cannot be saved.<br><br><br>[advice]<br>Overcome terrain with creative routes and methods<br><br>As you climb, your head may hit obstacles and return to the starting point. This will be painful, but it will make you more proficient and stronger.<br><br>I do not recommend this game if you want to finish the game easily.<br><br>I recommend this game to those who like difficult things and are persistent challengers.<br><br>good luck...",
